{"duration_api_ms": 410430, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "d524b068-13eb-4d3a-b3a7-fdcb281b3553", "total_cost_usd": 0.750599935, "usage": {"input_tokens": 14, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 42996, "cache_read_input_tokens": 188900, "output_tokens": 7368, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 113}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 42996}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 818, "cache_read_input_tokens": 43229, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 248, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 248, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 14, "outputTokens": 7368, "cacheReadInputTokens": 188900, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 42996, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.400176, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 113, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 64, "outputTokens": 80942, "cacheReadInputTokens": 3597202, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 157003, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.35042393499999996, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 56521, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 1, "unset": 0}, "started_in_background": 0, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 7, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "The spec is implemented and the required check passes: `pytest -q -n 4 tests/config --ignore=tests/config/cli/test_argcomplete.py` gives **7037 passed, 2 skipped**. Before the change, 134 tests failed. The implementer only changed the six files the spec lists and left the test files alone. I read through the whole diff and it follows the spec.\n\n**What changed:**\n- **Overrides are substituted now.** A `set_env` override from `-x` or `TOX_OVERRIDE` is built like a value from the config file. So `{env_name}`, `{env:...}`, `{posargs}`, `file|` lines and `{env:BLOCK}` lines all resolve.\n- **`set_env+=` adds to the existing value lazily** (`SetEnv.extend`). Values are read only when needed, so a later key or file can still change them.\n- **References keep the override rules.** When another section points at an overridden `set_env` (INI `{[testenv]set_env}` or TOML `replace=\"ref\"`), it gets a `SetEnvReference` rather than raw text with the override pasted on. The new error cases from the spec are in: a `set_env` that references itself, a TOML reference with the wrong shape, and a bad env-file line, which is now raised as `Fail`.\n- **`PYTHONIOENCODING`** is now one of tox's exported variables, so it always wins.\n\n**Where the implementer departed from the spec's wording** (I think all three are right; the tests need them):\n- **Keys from a reference:** keys that a later entry assigns are kept out of both the immediate merge and the final merge. Following the spec literally would let the reference overwrite `MAGIC=\"child\"` in `[ref, {MAGIC=\"child\"}]`.\n- **Emptied base in INI:** when factor filtering empties the base `set_env` and there are overrides, it continues with an empty base instead of returning `\"\"`. That way `MAGIC=appended` still applies.\n- **Listing keys:** `__iter__` takes a copy of the already-read keys first. Without it, an export callback that reads another export could make a key go missing.\n\n**Not checked:**\n- **Lint:** `ruff` isn't installed in the venv, so lint and format weren't run.\n- **The rest of `tests/`** (outside `tests/config`), per the implementer: 1 failure and 7 errors. The implementer says they come from missing tools (`tombi` and the argcomplete completer) rather than this change. I didn't re-run them.", "ttft_ms": 2627, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 487621, "uuid": "160ea40e-861c-4f71-b9e6-bd94c104bb9c", "ttft_stream_ms": 2076, "time_to_request_ms": 493, "first_content_frame_ms": 2076, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
